/**
 * What `--sandbox` adds beyond "sign for Celo Sepolia": a wallet that exists
 * without setup, and funds that arrive without a browser.
 *
 * Both halves live here so every command that pays or reports a balance —
 * curl, fetch, whoami, send — gets the same account the same way and says the
 * same one line about it. The MCP tools do the same through the keystore and
 * core helpers directly; what this module adds on top is the CLI's stderr.
 */
